msgstr "构建并运行图"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:32 ../../en/user-guide/index.md:75
msgid "Record Observables"
msgstr "记录 Observable"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:39 ../../en/user-guide/index.md:75
msgid "Manage projects and artifacts"
msgstr "管理项目和产物"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:46 ../../en/user-guide/index.md:75
msgid "Use a remote GPU"
msgstr "使用远程 GPU"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:53 ../../en/user-guide/index.md:75
msgid "Make a result reproducible"
msgstr "让结果可复现"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:60 ../../en/user-guide/index.md:75
msgid "Troubleshoot a run"
msgstr "排查一次运行"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:67 ../../en/user-guide/index.md:75
msgid "Understand graph execution"
msgstr "理解图执行"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:7
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "用户指南"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:10
msgid "Work with experiments"
msgstr "处理实验"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Build a valid training graph, choose measurements deliberately, preserve the"
" right artifact, and diagnose failures from the Trainer outward."
msgstr "构建有效训练图，审慎选择测量，保留合适的产物，并从 Trainer 向外诊断故障。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:17
msgid ""
"Start with the task you are trying to complete. Concept pages explain why "
"the application behaves that way without repeating the same sequence of "
"clicks."
msgstr "从你想完成的任务开始。概念页面解释应用为何如此工作，而不重复同一串点击操作。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:29
msgid ""
"Assemble the stable training core, validate its connections, and run a "
"focused parameter series."
msgstr "组装稳定训练核心，验证其连接，并运行聚焦的参数序列。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:36
msgid "Attach measurements without confusing them with the optimization objective."
msgstr "添加测量，但不要将其与优化目标混淆。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:43
msgid ""
"Organize canvases and choose Small, Medium, or Large persistence "
"intentionally."
msgstr "组织画布，并有意识地选择 Small、Medium 或 Large 持久化。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:50
msgid ""
"Configure SSH execution, verify the target, and keep credentials out of "
"research artifacts."
msgstr "配置 SSH 执行，验证目标，并让凭据远离研究产物。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:57
msgid "Record the graph, environment, seeds, measurements, and claim boundary."
msgstr "记录图、环境、种子、测量和结论边界。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:64
msgid "Work from visible symptoms to graph, device, service, or measurement causes."
msgstr "从可见症状出发，定位图、设备、服务或测量原因。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/index.md:71
msgid ""
"Learn how graph fields and edges become a validated backend request and "
"streamed result."
msgstr "了解图字段和边如何成为经过验证的后端请求与流式结果。"
